{"assets":[],"contentKind":"statement","contestId":"119","diagnostics":[],"document":{"children":[{"attrs":{"level":1,"role":"title"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"C. Education Reform"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"time_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"time limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"1 second"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"memory_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"memory limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"256 megabytes"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"body"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Yet another education system reform has been carried out in Berland recently. The innovations are as follows:"}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"An academic year now consists of "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"n"},{"kind":"text","text":" days. Each day pupils study exactly one of "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"m"},{"kind":"text","text":" subjects, besides, each subject is studied for no more than one day. After the lessons of the "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"i"},{"kind":"text","text":"-th subject pupils get the home task that contains no less than "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"ai"},{"kind":"text","text":" and no more than "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"bi"},{"kind":"text","text":" exercises. Besides, each subject has a special attribute, the complexity ("},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"ci"},{"kind":"text","text":"). A school can make its own timetable, considering the following conditions are satisfied:"}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"attrs":{"ordered":false},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" the timetable should contain the subjects in the order of the complexity's strict increasing; "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" each day, except for the first one, the task should contain either "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"k"},{"kind":"text","text":" times more exercises, or more by "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"k"},{"kind":"text","text":" compared to the previous day (more formally: let's call the number of home task exercises in the "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"i"},{"kind":"text","text":"-th day as "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"xi"},{"kind":"text","text":", then for each "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"i"},{"kind":"text","text":" ("},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"1 < i ≤ n"},{"kind":"text","text":"): either "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"xi = k + xi - 1"},{"kind":"text","text":" or "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"xi = k·xi - 1"},{"kind":"text","text":" must be true); "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" the total number of exercises in all home tasks should be maximal possible. "}],"kind":"list_item"}],"kind":"list"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"All limitations are separately set for each school."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"It turned out that in many cases "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"ai"},{"kind":"text","text":" and "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"bi"},{"kind":"text","text":" reach "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"1016"},{"kind":"text","text":" (however, as the Berland Minister of Education is famous for his love to half-measures, the value of "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"bi - ai"},{"kind":"text","text":" doesn't exceed "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"100"},{"kind":"text","text":"). That also happened in the Berland School №256. Nevertheless, you as the school's principal still have to work out the timetable for the next academic year..."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"input_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The first line contains three integers "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"n"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"m"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"k"},{"kind":"text","text":" ("},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"1 ≤ n ≤ m ≤ 50"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"1 ≤ k ≤ 100"},{"kind":"text","text":") which represent the number of days in an academic year, the number of subjects and the "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"k"},{"kind":"text","text":" parameter correspondingly. Each of the following "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"m"},{"kind":"text","text":" lines contains the description of a subject as three integers "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"ai"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"bi"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"ci"},{"kind":"text","text":" ("},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"1 ≤ ai ≤ bi ≤ 1016"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"bi - ai ≤ 100"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"1 ≤ ci ≤ 100"},{"kind":"text","text":") — two limitations to the number of exercises on the "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"i"},{"kind":"text","text":"-th subject and the complexity of the "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"i"},{"kind":"text","text":"-th subject, correspondingly. Distinct subjects can have the same complexity. The subjects are numbered with integers from "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"1"},{"kind":"text","text":" to "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"m"},{"kind":"text","text":". "}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Please do not use the "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"%lld"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" specificator to read or write 64-bit numbers in С++. It is preferred to use the "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"cin"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" stream or the "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"%I64d"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" specificator."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"output_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"If no valid solution exists, print the single word \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"NO"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\" (without the quotes). Otherwise, the first line should contain the word \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"YES"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\" (without the quotes) and the next "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"n"},{"kind":"text","text":" lines should contain any timetable that satisfies all the conditions. The "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"i + 1"},{"kind":"text","text":"-th line should contain two positive integers: the number of the subject to study on the "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"i"},{"kind":"text","text":"-th day and the number of home task exercises given for this subject. The timetable should contain exactly "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"n"},{"kind":"text","text":" subjects."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"samples"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Examples"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"4 5 2\n1 10 1\n1 10 2\n1 10 3\n1 20 4\n1 100 5\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"YES\n2 8\n3 10\n4 20\n5 40\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"3 4 3\n1 3 1\n2 4 4\n2 3 3\n2 2 2\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"NO"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"document"},"index":"C","problemCode":"119C","schema":2,"sourceKind":"html","sourceUrl":"https://codeforces.com/contest/119/problem/C"}